# Replace every value enclosed in angle brackets.
UseBridges 1
ClientTransportPlugin detorrent exec <WFDEF_ROOT>/build/obfs4proxy
Bridge detorrent <BRIDGE_IP>:<PT_PORT> <BRIDGE_FINGERPRINT> cert=<CERT> budget=<BUDGET> generator-addr=127.0.0.1:19991

SocksPort 127.0.0.1:<SOCKS_PORT>
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:<CONTROL_PORT>
CookieAuthentication 1
DataDirectory <CLIENT_DATA_DIRECTORY>
Log notice file <CLIENT_LOG_PATH>
